Usage: namei [OPTION]... PATH...

Call namei on each PATH, showing any symlink resolution.
Displays the resolution steps for each path component.

OPTIONS:
  -a, --access    also print access permissions
  -d, --noreport  do not follow symlink if final component
  -m              show permissions as symbols (rwx)
  -l, --long      long format (permissions and mode info)
      --help      display this help and exit
  -V, --version   output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
